# Local runtime state written by the dev server. `users.json` holds password
# hashes, `sessions.json` holds live tokens and `db.json` holds a learner's
# own plan and attempts — none of it belongs in the repo. The server recreates
# db.json from its defaults when it is missing.
data/users.json
data/sessions.json
data/db.json

# The project's lockfile is bun.lock; a second lockfile from a local npm
# install would only fight with it.
package-lock.json
